    "type": "game",
    "name": "Super Bouncy Gumball Party",
    "steam_appid": 3391990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy the Bricks - Defend the Blocks - Collect the Gems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and bounce the <strong>Super Bouncy Gumball </strong>to<strong> </strong>break the <strong>Bricks</strong> in each stage, but be warned; Every hit increases the speed and the <strong>Blocks </strong>you stand on can be damaged and destroyed as well. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>\u00a0The Goodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of <strong>Power-Ups</strong> like the classic <strong>Double Jump</strong>, the fun <strong>Low Gravity</strong> or the game changing <strong>Super Bubble</strong> to reach the <strong>Bonus Stage</strong> and set the <strong>Hi Score</strong>. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>The Baddies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight different types of enemies, including <strong>Slimes, Zombies, Exploding Bombs, Aliens</strong>, <strong>Wizards</strong> and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>The Heroes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a cast of silly characters to play as, such as a cute <strong>Kitty</strong>, a grumpy <strong>Vampire</strong> or an acrobatic <strong>Ninja</strong>. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>The Universe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the <strong>8 Worlds i</strong>ntroduces<strong>\u00a0</strong>a new gameplay mechanic like <strong>Bouncy Pads, Bumpers</strong> and <strong>Portals</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>The Buddies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the entire game, locally with a friend. \u00a0Any saved game can be played <strong>Co-Op</strong> or <strong>Solo</strong> mode.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy the Bricks - Defend the Blocks - Collect the Gems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and bounce the <strong>Super Bouncy Gumball </strong>to<strong> </strong>break the <strong>Bricks</strong> in each stage, but be warned; Every hit increases the speed and the <strong>Blocks </strong>you stand on can be damaged and destroyed as well. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022<strong>\u00a0The Goodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of <strong>Power-Ups</strong> like the classic <strong>Double Jump</strong>, the fun <strong>Low Gravity</strong> or the game changing <strong>Super Bubble</strong> to reach the <strong>Bonus Stage</strong> and set the <strong>Hi Score</strong>. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>The Baddies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight different types of enemies, including <strong>Slimes, Zombies, Exploding Bombs, Aliens</strong>, <strong>Wizards</strong> and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>The Heroes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a cast of silly characters to play as, such as a cute <strong>Kitty</strong>, a grumpy <strong>Vampire</strong> or an acrobatic <strong>Ninja</strong>. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>The Universe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the <strong>8 Worlds i</strong>ntroduces<strong>\u00a0</strong>a new gameplay mechanic like <strong>Bouncy Pads, Bumpers</strong> and <strong>Portals</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>The Buddies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the entire game, locally with a friend. \u00a0Any saved game can be played <strong>Co-Op</strong> or <strong>Solo</strong> mode.</p>",
    "short_description": "An arcade style, micro-platformer with a puzzling twist. \u00a0Use your platforming skills to bounce the ever accelerating Super Bouncy Gumball into the bricks, all while endless waves of enemies are trying to stop you. \u00a0",
